something obvious that I am missing.<br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">If someone can help me with this very soon I would really appreciate it! This is for an assignment that is due today and it is crucial that I get it done on time.</span><br></p></div>"
